  "difficulty_level": "H3",
  "difficulty_reason": "The selected research obligation is existential-real completeness for exact training under two inputs, two outputs, thirteen labels and a linear number of rational data points. The human reduction supplies interacting variable, inversion and lower-bound gadgets and a global minimum-breakline budget, then proves that three vertical point samples per data line force the intended gadget geometry. The shared breakline types and finite-data soundness, together with polynomial-bit rational layout, are a new nonroutine core beyond ordinary real-algebraic reduction prerequisites.",
